WEBVTT

01:27.905 --> 01:28.985
LOVE & CROWN

01:29.065 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 21

01:54.665 --> 01:57.505
I didn't expect Xiao Huan
to be such a romantic.

01:58.065 --> 01:59.025
Don't move.

02:01.025 --> 02:02.105
How could this happen?

02:02.185 --> 02:03.585
Sorry to disappoint you.

02:03.665 --> 02:04.825
I've woken up.

02:24.545 --> 02:25.585
This can't be!

02:26.465 --> 02:28.785
How could my
Illusion-Butterfly Powder fail?

02:29.705 --> 02:32.465
How is it that you're both standing here?

02:35.905 --> 02:37.625
The Frost Reed can cure any poison.

02:38.185 --> 02:41.385
It seems
your investigation wasn't thorough enough.

02:49.705 --> 02:50.705
Cangcang!

02:50.785 --> 02:51.825
Zhong Lin!

02:51.905 --> 02:53.265
-Are you all right?
-We're fine.

02:53.345 --> 02:55.145
Thanks to the Puppet Incense
that Xiao Qianqing brought,

02:55.225 --> 02:56.145
we managed to control one of the servants.

02:56.225 --> 02:57.345
Good.

02:57.425 --> 02:58.545
The antidote. Quickly.

03:03.665 --> 03:04.665
Let's go.

03:13.945 --> 03:15.825
Release the branch leader. And we'll
leave you both with intact bodies!

03:16.505 --> 03:17.345
Clear the way.

03:18.745 --> 03:19.785
Make way.

03:20.985 --> 03:21.985
Hurry!

04:00.505 --> 04:03.025
Xiao Huan,
do you really think you can escape?

04:03.745 --> 04:04.905
I'll give you one more chance.

04:05.625 --> 04:07.545
Hand over the Moon-Eclipse,

04:08.145 --> 04:10.865
or I'll make sure all
of you lose your senses

04:10.945 --> 04:12.545
and perish with your meridians severed.

04:17.064 --> 04:18.384
Zhong Lin.

04:20.585 --> 04:21.545
Insolent.

04:26.185 --> 04:27.425
Protector, have mercy!

04:27.505 --> 04:28.345
I only sought to present

04:28.945 --> 04:30.625
the Moon-Eclipse to you.

04:30.705 --> 04:31.985
Is that so?

04:32.065 --> 04:33.145
My sources tell me you intend

04:33.705 --> 04:35.265
to become the Ghost King yourself.

04:55.745 --> 04:56.585
Die!

05:14.625 --> 05:15.705
Luo Xianxue?

06:09.905 --> 06:10.865
Luo.

06:40.185 --> 06:41.345
I'm glad you're safe.

06:43.945 --> 06:45.185
That day,

06:45.265 --> 06:47.425
I watched you be
engulfed in flames with my own eyes.

06:47.505 --> 06:49.505
Father sent someone to retrieve your body,

06:50.185 --> 06:52.025
and they found
a severed finger on it as well.

06:52.105 --> 06:53.785
I thought I'd never see you again.

06:54.545 --> 06:55.905
How did you escape?

06:56.585 --> 06:58.465
There was a cellar in the liquor storage.

06:59.265 --> 07:02.625
I hid there and barely survived.

07:04.625 --> 07:07.745
You never came looking for me.

07:11.025 --> 07:12.065
I knew

07:12.585 --> 07:14.785
His Majesty saw me as a thorn in his side.

07:14.865 --> 07:16.385
If I appeared recklessly,

07:17.345 --> 07:18.865
I'd only bring you trouble.

07:19.505 --> 07:20.505
So,

07:21.065 --> 07:22.905
I planned to wander the world.

07:25.865 --> 07:27.465
And now you've appeared out of nowhere.

07:28.985 --> 07:30.145
Do you intend to assassinate him?

07:33.185 --> 07:34.185
Why?

07:37.465 --> 07:38.545
I don't want

07:40.345 --> 07:41.345
to see you hurt,

07:42.865 --> 07:43.985
suffering,

07:45.025 --> 07:46.105
or endangered because of him.

07:47.905 --> 07:50.705
Cangcang, he's your tribulation.

07:51.545 --> 07:52.785
Don't let yourself get
entangled with him anymore.

07:54.705 --> 07:57.545
If you can't make up your mind,
I can help.

08:01.545 --> 08:02.585
Luo,

08:03.185 --> 08:04.385
so much has happened

08:04.465 --> 08:06.625
between him and me since you left.

08:07.625 --> 08:10.705
It's not as simple as you think.

08:11.225 --> 08:12.945
Even I didn't expect some things.

08:15.185 --> 08:16.185
He and I…

08:18.985 --> 08:21.065
Nobody can decide our matters for me.

08:23.385 --> 08:24.265
I overstepped.

08:25.985 --> 08:27.585
That's not what I meant.

08:27.665 --> 08:29.345
-Luo, I…
-Cangcang.

08:29.945 --> 08:30.985
Have you forgotten?

08:32.105 --> 08:33.505
You saved my life.

08:34.105 --> 08:36.985
Protecting you is my lifelong duty.

08:38.625 --> 08:39.985
I don't want to see you harmed in any way.

08:44.185 --> 08:46.785
I heard they raided
an evildoer's base around here.

08:46.865 --> 08:48.185
Many missing children were found.

08:48.985 --> 08:52.025
Many of them were silenced.

08:55.785 --> 08:56.945
He moved!

09:12.945 --> 09:14.905
They say you're dying.

09:15.945 --> 09:16.945
I won't allow it.

09:17.025 --> 09:19.625
Luo Xianxue, you are not to die
without my permission.

09:23.185 --> 09:25.665
I, Luo Xianxue, swear to the heavens.

09:25.745 --> 09:27.705
I, Luo Xianxue, swear to the heavens.

09:27.785 --> 09:29.785
From now on, I belong to Ling Cangcang.

09:29.865 --> 09:31.745
From now on, I belong to Ling Cangcang.

09:31.825 --> 09:32.865
No matter how hard it gets,

09:32.945 --> 09:35.465
I will stay strong for Ling Cangcang.

09:35.545 --> 09:37.105
No matter how hard it gets,

09:37.185 --> 09:40.425
I will stay strong for Ling Cangcang.

09:41.785 --> 09:42.745
Cangcang,

09:43.265 --> 09:44.305
it's for you

09:44.945 --> 09:47.225
that I crawled my way out of that fire.

09:52.505 --> 09:53.345
Luo,

09:54.705 --> 09:56.345
ever since you joined the Ling family,

09:56.425 --> 09:58.585
you've always been a brother to me.

09:59.105 --> 10:00.265
Do you remember

10:00.345 --> 10:02.985
the vow I made when I entered the palace?

10:03.065 --> 10:05.145
I will protect
everyone in the Ling family.

10:05.225 --> 10:06.065
I've never changed.

10:07.705 --> 10:08.545
It's just…

10:11.425 --> 10:12.705
With Xiao Huan,

10:13.625 --> 10:14.665
I now…

10:14.745 --> 10:17.225
So, no matter how much he hurts you,

10:18.585 --> 10:20.105
you won't hurt him back.

10:20.665 --> 10:21.705
Is that right?

10:28.465 --> 10:29.345
Luo,

10:29.865 --> 10:31.945
I think there are many misunderstandings
between you two.

10:32.985 --> 10:34.825
It will take time to clear them up.

10:35.905 --> 10:36.865
All right.

10:37.545 --> 10:38.665
If that's the case,

10:39.545 --> 10:40.745
we'll talk next time.

10:42.945 --> 10:44.025
Good.

10:52.065 --> 10:52.905
Cangcang,

10:53.665 --> 10:54.825
I remember you've always loved

10:54.905 --> 10:56.465
pear blossom honey since you were little.

10:57.145 --> 10:59.505
I brought some especially for you.

11:00.785 --> 11:03.865
I didn't expect
you still remember after all this time.

11:04.425 --> 11:05.265
Of course.

11:20.025 --> 11:20.865
Try it while it's warm.

11:36.225 --> 11:37.545
It's the taste I remember.

12:12.945 --> 12:14.145
It's been…

12:16.265 --> 12:17.625
It's been…

12:19.545 --> 12:20.665
Cangcang!

13:19.865 --> 13:20.865
Luo Xianxue.

13:21.745 --> 13:23.385
I know why you came.

13:23.985 --> 13:25.625
If you really wanted to be dead,

13:26.145 --> 13:27.105
you wouldn't show up.

13:27.705 --> 13:28.945
Let's cut the chatter.

13:29.625 --> 13:30.785
Hand over the Moon-Eclipse

13:31.385 --> 13:32.505
and face your fate.

13:34.105 --> 13:35.465
Do you know what you're saying?

13:36.185 --> 13:38.585
There will be a battle between us.

13:40.145 --> 13:42.625
Have you thought about
what will happen to Cangcang?

13:42.705 --> 13:43.945
I will never hurt her.

13:44.025 --> 13:45.345
You already have.

13:46.185 --> 13:48.865
You know Ling Xuefeng is using you
to rebuild the Lingbi Sect,

13:48.945 --> 13:50.985
yet you willingly serve as his dog.

13:51.065 --> 13:53.625
You know how Cangcang feels about me,

13:53.705 --> 13:55.705
yet you help Ling Xuefeng to kill me.

13:56.265 --> 13:58.505
What do you expect
Cangcang to think or do?

14:02.865 --> 14:04.545
Enough talk. Fight me!

14:06.825 --> 14:07.625
Stop!

14:13.425 --> 14:15.025
-Cangcang…
-You lied to me.

14:16.145 --> 14:16.985
You weren't supposed to be…

14:17.065 --> 14:19.025
I've used inner force to remove
the sedative in the pear blossom honey.

14:20.505 --> 14:22.265
Your "death" was flawless.

14:23.505 --> 14:25.145
You couldn't have done it alone.

14:27.185 --> 14:28.265
What's really going on?

14:30.705 --> 14:31.705
Cangcang,

14:32.705 --> 14:35.465
you and Father saved my life.

14:36.465 --> 14:37.385
I must obey

14:38.305 --> 14:39.225
his command.

14:39.945 --> 14:40.825
My father?

14:42.625 --> 14:43.465
What order did my father give you?

14:45.425 --> 14:46.305
He must die

14:47.105 --> 14:48.305
today.

14:48.905 --> 14:51.065
-You won't succeed!
-Cangcang, move aside!

14:56.625 --> 14:58.825
The Xiaoxing Guards
are already lying in wait.

14:58.905 --> 15:00.145
You can't do anything to me.

15:08.265 --> 15:09.625
Luo Xianxue,

15:10.385 --> 15:12.745
you loyally serve Grand Tutor Ling.

15:13.425 --> 15:14.305
But sadly,

15:15.505 --> 15:17.105
you're a fool.

15:17.185 --> 15:19.905
Do you know what
Grand Tutor Ling has done?

15:21.625 --> 15:23.105
Whatever he does,

15:23.625 --> 15:24.465
it's all for the Ling clan

15:25.465 --> 15:26.865
and Cangcang.

15:26.945 --> 15:27.825
Is it?

15:28.425 --> 15:29.625
Do you know Grand Tutor Ling

15:29.705 --> 15:32.105
poisoned Ling Cangcang
to force His Majesty

15:32.185 --> 15:34.265
to give her the cure?

15:37.345 --> 15:39.065
Were his actions really
for Ling Cangcang's sake?

15:42.425 --> 15:43.385
What?

15:46.705 --> 15:47.825
My father…

15:53.665 --> 15:54.705
Was it

15:55.985 --> 15:57.465
the pear blossom honey?

15:57.545 --> 15:59.345
Grand Tutor Ling brought
this pear blossom honey today.

15:59.425 --> 16:01.265
I added four spoonfuls as instructed.

16:07.305 --> 16:08.505
Luo Xianxue,

16:09.505 --> 16:10.585
surrender yourself.

16:10.665 --> 16:12.265
-Never!
-Wait.

16:25.265 --> 16:26.305
Your Majesty.

16:30.345 --> 16:31.465
Let him go.

16:32.705 --> 16:34.385
-Let him go?
-Cangcang!

16:34.465 --> 16:35.345
Go!

16:37.905 --> 16:38.825
I never want to see you again.

16:42.385 --> 16:43.585
Leave!

16:49.025 --> 16:49.865
Very well.

16:51.185 --> 16:52.185
Leave.

17:26.345 --> 17:27.505
So it was all

17:29.025 --> 17:30.225
my father's doing…

17:31.705 --> 17:32.945
You should go back.

17:33.785 --> 17:34.785
I need some time to myself.

18:03.985 --> 18:07.025
I wish to resign of my own accord.

18:07.105 --> 18:08.625
I only ask that Your Majesty

18:09.185 --> 18:11.985
will be merciful and spare

18:14.425 --> 18:16.145
my only daughter.

18:37.785 --> 18:40.865
QI

19:27.025 --> 19:28.625
They've returned at last.

19:44.585 --> 19:48.945
We welcome the return of
His Majesty and Her Majesty.

20:56.225 --> 20:57.945
It's been a while, everyone.

20:58.545 --> 20:59.665
I hope all has been well.

21:04.945 --> 21:06.065
I dare to ask,

21:06.745 --> 21:08.905
Your Highness, how much longer

21:09.785 --> 21:11.745
will you govern on behalf of His Majesty?

21:13.945 --> 21:14.905
Well…

21:16.025 --> 21:17.865
His Majesty's health has greatly improved

21:18.665 --> 21:20.265
but still requires rest.

21:20.865 --> 21:23.745
You'll have to deal
with me for a while longer,

21:23.825 --> 21:25.105
Grand Tutor Ling.

21:25.625 --> 21:28.185
His Majesty and Her Majesty
share a deep and enduring love.

21:28.265 --> 21:31.025
It is a blessing for Great Qi.

21:31.105 --> 21:31.985
Enough of these words.

21:32.745 --> 21:33.985
Save them

21:34.065 --> 21:36.425
for when His Majesty
returns from the outer palace

21:36.505 --> 21:37.745
to hear it himself.

21:39.865 --> 21:41.585
Now, let us discuss
the situation in Xuzhou.

21:42.385 --> 21:43.625
The disaster in Xuzhou

21:44.225 --> 21:46.225
has been temporarily contained.

21:46.985 --> 21:49.545
Sadly, Song Lanxi

21:50.065 --> 21:50.985
was killed.

21:51.665 --> 21:53.785
Mr. Song was killed?

21:53.865 --> 21:54.745
Mr. Li,

21:55.265 --> 21:57.065
I have failed you.

22:03.145 --> 22:05.745
Lanxi sacrificed himself for the country.

22:05.825 --> 22:08.985
I pray Your Highness will investigate
the culprits behind the unrest.

22:09.585 --> 22:10.865
Rest assured.

22:10.945 --> 22:12.825
It is my duty.

22:16.185 --> 22:17.265
That said,

22:17.345 --> 22:20.265
the position of Governor
of Xuzhou remains vacant.

22:20.345 --> 22:22.985
There is no suitable candidate in Xuzhou.

22:23.585 --> 22:25.625
From what I know,

22:26.425 --> 22:28.385
the former Governor

22:28.985 --> 22:31.865
was once under
Grand Tutor Ling's tutelage.

22:32.625 --> 22:36.065
Might you have any suggestions

22:36.945 --> 22:38.425
for the new Governor,

22:38.505 --> 22:40.145
Grand Tutor Ling?

22:40.225 --> 22:41.905
I never expected

22:41.985 --> 22:44.465
the Governor of Xuzhou

22:44.545 --> 22:47.505
to commit such unforgivable acts!

22:49.145 --> 22:51.945
He ignored my warnings.

22:52.025 --> 22:54.585
It brings shame upon me.

22:57.505 --> 22:58.425
Indeed.

22:59.145 --> 23:00.785
I was also taken aback.

23:04.465 --> 23:07.345
Mr. Li, you've returned to court.

23:07.945 --> 23:10.785
I entrust you to recommend
a governor for Xuzhou.

23:10.865 --> 23:13.265
Yes, Your Highness.

23:19.665 --> 23:21.985
My Lord, His Majesty and Her Majesty
have arrived at the outer palace.

23:26.665 --> 23:29.305
Still no word from Xianxue?

23:29.385 --> 23:30.225
No.

23:36.945 --> 23:39.785
We grew up together.

23:40.465 --> 23:44.865
My mission is to protect Cangcang.

23:44.945 --> 23:47.865
But now,
she no longer needs your protection.

23:47.945 --> 23:49.185
-Who said that?
-His Majesty.

23:55.025 --> 23:56.265
Then what am I to do?

23:57.025 --> 23:59.065
Do whatever you wish.

23:59.665 --> 24:01.865
Be carefree and at ease.

24:01.945 --> 24:03.105
Isn't that a good thing?

24:07.985 --> 24:09.905
Can I?

24:13.385 --> 24:14.425
You can.

24:27.545 --> 24:29.425
I think so too.

25:04.665 --> 25:05.665
How is it?

25:07.545 --> 25:09.305
How is what?

25:09.385 --> 25:12.985
The taste when
you kissed my forehead just now.

25:21.145 --> 25:22.305
I…

25:23.585 --> 25:26.665
There's a lingering
aroma of liquor on my lips.

25:28.665 --> 25:30.265
Would you like to taste it?

25:57.025 --> 25:57.985
Sweet,

25:59.225 --> 26:00.585
but slightly astringent.

26:28.545 --> 26:30.945
Young Master, what are you…

26:31.025 --> 26:32.145
Answer me.

26:32.945 --> 26:35.505
Did you really poison
Young Lady's pear blossom honey?

26:37.105 --> 26:38.105
Did you?

26:49.425 --> 26:50.745
I can't believe it's true.

26:51.505 --> 26:52.705
Father actually meant to harm Cangcang.

26:53.385 --> 26:54.225
No.

26:54.985 --> 26:56.545
He had his reasons.

26:56.625 --> 26:58.545
Everything he does is for her

26:59.265 --> 27:00.505
and the Ling clan.

27:00.585 --> 27:02.225
He never meant her harm.

27:03.305 --> 27:04.305
Then, answer this.

27:05.025 --> 27:08.345
If that person hadn't
given her the antidote,

27:09.385 --> 27:10.665
what would have happened?

27:13.105 --> 27:14.745
You're gambling with her life!

27:52.425 --> 27:53.865
Luo Xianxue!

27:54.985 --> 27:58.065
I pulled you back from the brink of death
and took you in.

27:58.145 --> 28:00.025
Is this how you repay me?

28:00.905 --> 28:03.065
I am Cangcang's father.

28:04.225 --> 28:05.865
Everything I do

28:05.945 --> 28:07.105
is for her good.

28:08.105 --> 28:09.225
Xianxue,

28:10.425 --> 28:12.905
this is the path she must walk.

28:12.985 --> 28:14.425
All we can do

28:15.825 --> 28:17.825
is pave the way for her

28:17.905 --> 28:19.825
to travel steadily

28:21.105 --> 28:22.705
and far.

28:23.945 --> 28:25.625
I know your heart aches.

28:26.425 --> 28:29.425
As a father, so does mine.

28:30.585 --> 28:33.225
But this is the truth she longs for

28:34.345 --> 28:36.865
and the reality she must face.

28:37.425 --> 28:40.345
I beg Your Majesty

28:40.425 --> 28:42.145
to spare the Ling clan

28:43.105 --> 28:44.265
and Luo Xianxue.

28:44.825 --> 28:45.825
I offer myself

28:46.625 --> 28:48.225
as Your Majesty's consort.

28:49.385 --> 28:51.985
May Your Majesty grant my request.

28:52.985 --> 28:54.065
Xiao Huan,

28:54.145 --> 28:55.785
let him go!

29:01.065 --> 29:01.905
Let him go.

29:07.545 --> 29:08.665
I'm sorry.

29:09.905 --> 29:11.385
I was the one who was wrong.

29:13.785 --> 29:15.465
I thought I was protecting you,

29:17.385 --> 29:19.105
yet I brought you nothing but harm.

29:32.545 --> 29:33.625
Cangcang,

29:35.705 --> 29:37.945
I swear to the heavens.

29:39.145 --> 29:40.425
From this day forth,

29:41.545 --> 29:43.105
I will never let you suffer

29:43.785 --> 29:45.305
even the slightest harm.

30:26.065 --> 30:27.265
How did I end up here?

31:12.585 --> 31:13.945
Your Majesty,
I'll announce your arrival right away.

31:14.025 --> 31:14.985
Don't bother.

31:15.505 --> 31:18.705
The Emperor returned to court today.

31:18.785 --> 31:21.705
Yet, my son still has the nerve
to sleep soundly in his residence.

31:21.785 --> 31:23.385
Your Majesty, please mind your health.

31:31.145 --> 31:32.225
What…

31:46.545 --> 31:47.425
Greetings, Your Majesty.

31:49.185 --> 31:50.265
Where did you come from?

31:51.665 --> 31:53.985
Dishevelled and sneaking about.

31:54.585 --> 31:56.305
What are you doing at
the Prince of Yuzhang's manor?

31:58.305 --> 31:59.545
The night was young,

31:59.625 --> 32:01.425
and we made merry together.

32:02.025 --> 32:04.465
What else did you think we did?

32:04.545 --> 32:05.505
You…

32:07.425 --> 32:08.305
Your Majesty.

32:09.985 --> 32:11.145
Your Majesty.

32:13.465 --> 32:14.305
LINGHE HALL

32:14.385 --> 32:15.985
We welcome Her Majesty's return.

33:02.345 --> 33:04.785
FATE'S RISE AND FALL HEED NO ONE'S WILL

33:04.865 --> 33:08.705
WHERE FATE IS SOWN,
THE HEART MAKES ITS OWN CHOICE

33:19.585 --> 33:21.065
WHERE FATE IS SOWN,
THE HEART MAKES ITS OWN CHOICE

33:22.345 --> 33:23.185
Look at mine.

33:23.265 --> 33:24.345
See how high it is.

33:25.385 --> 33:26.225
Mine's higher.

33:26.745 --> 33:27.945
Zhong Lin,

33:28.025 --> 33:28.865
you brought me out of the palace.

33:28.945 --> 33:30.345
Is there something you want to tell me?

33:32.505 --> 33:33.625
I…

33:34.945 --> 33:35.985
Cangcang.

33:37.465 --> 33:38.745
You…

33:51.265 --> 33:52.665
What do you want to say?

33:54.825 --> 33:56.105
Nothing.

33:56.185 --> 33:58.065
You seemed to be in low spirits,

33:58.585 --> 34:00.345
so I thought a kite flying
outing might cheer you up.

34:04.185 --> 34:05.465
Cangcang,

34:05.545 --> 34:07.905
you've seemed unhappy lately.

34:07.985 --> 34:09.025
What's troubling you?

34:14.264 --> 34:15.264
I was thinking about my father.

34:16.225 --> 34:17.145
Grand Tutor Ling?

34:23.385 --> 34:25.145
Since our return from Jiangzhou

34:25.225 --> 34:26.945
and after meeting Luo Xianxue,

34:27.025 --> 34:28.824
you've been acting strangely.

34:28.905 --> 34:30.185
What happened?

34:33.145 --> 34:34.225
It wasn't until today

34:35.065 --> 34:37.105
that I pieced everything together.

34:38.304 --> 34:39.545
It turns out

34:40.425 --> 34:42.105
the mastermind behind all this

34:42.985 --> 34:44.025
was him.

34:47.625 --> 34:51.185
Xiao Huan never told me
about everything my father did.

34:54.185 --> 34:56.985
I think he wanted to protect me

34:58.225 --> 34:59.705
and feared I wouldn't be able to bear it.

35:01.985 --> 35:03.505
These past few days, I've been thinking.

35:05.785 --> 35:07.265
When did Father

35:08.465 --> 35:09.985
who cared for

35:11.105 --> 35:12.665
and protected me so much change?

35:14.025 --> 35:15.745
How could he do such things?

35:18.785 --> 35:19.825
Cangcang,

35:20.345 --> 35:22.305
you're his only daughter.

35:22.385 --> 35:23.505
He must love you.

35:27.385 --> 35:28.385
But how much

35:30.025 --> 35:31.745
of that love is genuine

35:33.065 --> 35:34.545
and how much is self-serving,

35:36.505 --> 35:38.145
I can no longer tell.

35:40.225 --> 35:41.265
He was certain

35:42.105 --> 35:44.465
Xiao Huan would use
the Frost Reed to save me.

35:45.265 --> 35:47.345
If I could successfully carry a child,

35:48.145 --> 35:49.785
he could support my child

35:50.305 --> 35:51.145
to ascend the throne.

35:54.345 --> 35:56.945
So what do we do now?

35:58.305 --> 35:59.945
The Grand Tutor has set his mind to this…

36:01.145 --> 36:02.825
What does His Majesty plan to do with him?

36:03.505 --> 36:05.585
Caught between the two,

36:05.665 --> 36:06.705
what should you do?

36:08.545 --> 36:10.265
Xiao Huan is a wise ruler of Great Qi.

36:10.985 --> 36:12.665
He is a good emperor for the people.

36:16.105 --> 36:17.105
To protect Great Qi,

36:19.145 --> 36:20.345
the stability of the nation,

36:20.985 --> 36:22.065
and the well-being of the people,

36:23.225 --> 36:25.105
I must stand alongside Xiao Huan

36:25.865 --> 36:26.985
as his equal.

36:28.425 --> 36:29.505
As for my father…

36:33.905 --> 36:34.945
I only hope

36:35.985 --> 36:37.265
he can still change his ways.

36:39.785 --> 36:41.745
But I haven't figured
out how to face him yet.

36:44.265 --> 36:46.665
Cangcang, he will.

36:47.265 --> 36:48.265
The Grand Tutor surely will.

36:54.065 --> 36:56.945
Shall we go fly kites? Don't dwell on it.

36:57.545 --> 36:59.945
Let all these worries and sorrows

37:00.025 --> 37:02.025
fly away like kites. All right?

37:03.265 --> 37:05.025
Come on. Come on!

37:09.865 --> 37:11.185
That boy runs fast.

37:11.265 --> 37:12.545
Yes.

37:12.625 --> 37:14.145
-Be careful.
-Wait for me!

37:16.625 --> 37:17.665
It flies so high!

37:21.905 --> 37:23.505
TAIJI HALL

37:23.585 --> 37:26.385
Today, I wish to discuss

37:26.465 --> 37:27.945
the abolition of the status
verification system in Jiangzhou.

37:28.945 --> 37:29.825
In addition,

37:29.905 --> 37:32.465
to implement temporary
centralized status verification nationwide

37:33.065 --> 37:34.265
and gradually abolish the system.

37:35.145 --> 37:37.225
Does anyone have objections?

37:48.345 --> 37:49.385
Your Majesty,

37:49.465 --> 37:52.425
while the temporary system might solve

37:52.505 --> 37:54.945
immediate concerns,

37:55.025 --> 37:57.065
it risks encouraging negative practices.

37:58.185 --> 38:00.185
Please consider carefully, Your Majesty.

38:00.785 --> 38:01.985
What negative practices?

38:03.425 --> 38:04.465
Well…

38:09.585 --> 38:10.425
Your Majesty,

38:11.025 --> 38:14.825
Minister Xing believes the root
of the vagrants' issues

38:14.905 --> 38:16.705
lies in registration and taxation.

38:17.345 --> 38:19.225
Centralizing the registration

38:19.305 --> 38:21.585
might cause taxation problems.

38:23.065 --> 38:25.625
Therefore, this can't continue.

38:26.225 --> 38:27.665
Since you brought up taxation,

38:27.745 --> 38:28.785
I've also given the matter some thought.

38:28.865 --> 38:31.945
This tax system was set during
the reign of the previous emperor.

38:32.025 --> 38:34.145
Shouldn't it be
improved to suit the times?

38:34.905 --> 38:38.305
Your Majesty, this tax system has
been in place for many decades.

38:38.905 --> 38:40.905
It has its reasons to exist.

38:40.985 --> 38:42.665
It won't do to change it

38:43.425 --> 38:44.825
on a whim.

38:55.825 --> 38:59.945
I believe
what Your Majesty has said is reasonable.

39:12.465 --> 39:13.745
Mr. Li is right.

39:14.745 --> 39:17.625
I also support Your Majesty's proposal.

39:20.225 --> 39:22.345
Prince of Yuzhang, what are your views?

39:22.425 --> 39:24.825
As His Majesty and Grand Tutor Ling said,

39:25.425 --> 39:28.345
the tax system hasn't changed for decades.

39:29.185 --> 39:31.825
But Great Qi's development never stops.

39:32.905 --> 39:36.665
I believe
this is the time to break the old ways

39:36.745 --> 39:38.105
and reform taxation.

39:39.505 --> 39:41.785
Prince of Yuzhang and
I are of the same opinion.

39:42.385 --> 39:44.705
The current tax system
has many types of levies

39:44.785 --> 39:46.985
which prompt
frequent corruption by officials.

39:47.065 --> 39:52.105
I have also considered
simplifying the collections

39:52.185 --> 39:53.265
and taxing by acreage instead.

39:53.345 --> 39:57.305
Of course,
all this is still under discussion.

39:57.865 --> 39:59.905
If any minister has ideas,

39:59.985 --> 40:01.305
please present them to me.

40:09.905 --> 40:11.665
Since no one else has anything to say,

40:12.265 --> 40:14.905
we'll end today's session here.

40:35.345 --> 40:36.345
You're grinning without reason.

40:37.265 --> 40:38.985
What cunning scheme

40:39.585 --> 40:42.065
is your wise self plotting now?

40:42.665 --> 40:46.025
I just think
you were especially impressive today.

40:46.625 --> 40:47.705
As a matter of fact,

40:47.785 --> 40:50.905
it has been a long time
since we had a proper conversation.

40:52.025 --> 40:54.305
Feel free to enjoy this
advantage you have earned.

40:55.905 --> 40:58.425
Well, what do you think of my idea?

40:59.025 --> 41:01.385
If the tax policies are simplified,

41:01.945 --> 41:03.625
officials will find it harder to cheat,

41:04.385 --> 41:06.545
so revenue should increase.

41:07.145 --> 41:08.305
More importantly,

41:08.985 --> 41:11.225
the people's tax burden will lessen.

41:11.825 --> 41:13.105
It is indeed a good proposal.

41:16.225 --> 41:17.065
However…

41:18.345 --> 41:19.545
However,

41:19.625 --> 41:21.985
the status verification issue
only treats the symptoms, not the cause.

41:26.305 --> 41:27.625
We'll take it slow.

41:27.705 --> 41:29.865
Reform takes time.

41:38.825 --> 41:40.505
I heard you stopped
Her Majesty's birth-control tea.

41:44.065 --> 41:45.105
You know about that?

41:46.305 --> 41:49.065
My mother cares about you having an heir

41:49.145 --> 41:50.025
much more than I do.

41:52.825 --> 41:53.705
I heard

41:54.385 --> 41:56.305
she is eager to find
a princess consort for you.

41:57.065 --> 41:57.905
What do you say?

41:57.985 --> 42:00.425
Would you like me to find you a few?

42:01.345 --> 42:02.425
I do regret

42:03.105 --> 42:05.185
meddling and saving you.

42:16.025 --> 42:17.065
Look.

42:17.665 --> 42:18.505
Victory is mine.

42:27.305 --> 42:29.905
Your Majesty,
is it true that you can roast pears?

42:30.505 --> 42:31.385
Yes.

42:32.465 --> 42:35.345
This is a recipe my mother invented.

42:41.385 --> 42:42.465
When I was little,

42:43.105 --> 42:43.945
I remember often

42:44.585 --> 42:47.185
roasting pears with my master and father…

42:48.385 --> 42:49.905
The Grand Tutor roasts pears too?

42:50.665 --> 42:54.185
I haven't roasted them in a while as well.

42:55.665 --> 42:58.425
-Father.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

43:00.985 --> 43:02.065
Please be seated.

43:03.065 --> 43:04.105
You as well, Your Majesty.

43:12.025 --> 43:13.345
Let me tell you something.

43:13.905 --> 43:15.105
Only the Jinye pears

43:15.745 --> 43:19.145
from Shuiquan Village
are best for roasting.

43:20.025 --> 43:21.625
They are full of juice.

43:21.705 --> 43:23.185
Once they're grilled,

43:23.265 --> 43:26.945
spread some of your favourite pear
blossom honey on them.

43:27.665 --> 43:30.425
You used to love it as a child.
